<title>USA: Eagle Financial names Britton chairman.</title>
<headline>Eagle Financial names Britton chairman.</headline>
<dateline>BRISTOL, Conn. 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eagle Financial Corp said it has named Robert Britton as chairman of the board.</p>
<p>Britton has served as an executive officer of Eagle since 1991 and a director since 1992. He was promoted to president and chief executive in 1994.</p>
<p>Britton succeeds Ralph Linsley, who served as chairman since January 1995.</p>
